OL,3,GNEWSAKey findings from Lucy Letby
OL,4,AThirlwall Inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe deaths and near-deaths of some
OL,7,Fbabies who were attacked by nurse Lucy
OL,8,FLetby could have been prevented if
OL,9,Fsafeguarding practices had been
OL,10,Ffollowed, the public inquiry into her
OL,11,Fcrimes has found.
OL,13,FDelivering the conclusion of her
OL,14,Finquiry, chairwoman Lady Justice
OL,15,FThirlwall said it would never be
OL,16,Fpossible to know for sure how many
OL,17,Flives could have been saved.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
