OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAKey findings from Lucy Letby
OL,4,AThirlwall Inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut she found there was a "complete
OL,7,Ffailure to protect babies on the
OL,8,Fneonatal unit" at the Countess of
OL,9,FChester Hospital, where Letby, now 36,
OL,10,Fmurdered seven babies and attempted to
OL,11,Fmurder seven others - one of them
OL,12,Ftwice.
OL,14,FThirlwall described a system of
OL,15,F"dysfunctional management and
OL,16,Fgovernance".
